1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:02,767
If I see that woman
anywhere near our house,

2
00:00:02,767 --> 00:00:05,533
I'll make her pay for this.
So annoying!

3
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:07,567
Hannah Montano!

4
00:00:09,033 --> 00:00:15,067
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

5
00:00:15,067 --> 00:00:17,567
Good to see
that you're still here.

6
00:00:19,033 --> 00:00:21,500
Where's your bag?

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,633
Why, ma'am?

8
00:00:22,633 --> 00:00:25,600
Miss Ria lost her jewelry.

9
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,233
You two were the only ones

10
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:29,000
in the presidential suite.

11
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,467
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

12
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,600
We weren't the only ones there.

13
00:00:37,167 --> 00:00:40,167
The security already
cleared Miss Brenda.

14
00:00:40,167 --> 00:00:43,267
Ma'am, wait.
Hannah is not a thief.

15
00:00:43,267 --> 00:00:44,700
Do you want to get involved?

16
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,100
No.

17
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,033
- It's all right, Katy.
- Hannah.

18
00:00:48,033 --> 00:00:50,367
I have nothing to be ashamed of.
I'm not hiding anything.

19
00:00:50,367 --> 00:00:57,233
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

20
00:01:14,100 --> 00:01:16,700
Well, well, well...

21
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:20,033
The former social climber...

22
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:25,833
is now a kleptomaniac!

23
00:01:25,833 --> 00:01:32,700
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

24
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:46,233
<i> So pretty!</i>

25
00:01:46,233 --> 00:01:47,567
<i> Very fresh!</i>

26
00:01:47,567 --> 00:01:48,700
<i> Yes!</i>

27
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:51,367
<i> She's so pretty. Yes!</i>

28
00:01:51,367 --> 00:01:54,500
<i> You're glowing! Wow!</i>

29
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:57,367
<i> Go on, pose some more.</i>

30
00:01:57,367 --> 00:01:59,800
<i> To the right, to the left.</i>

31
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:03,100
<i>Oh, she's posing.
Yes. Beautiful!</i>

32
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:09,767
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]
